  // DecisionsQuestionPage / DecisionsQuestion — decisions owed (a question page)
  'decisions.title': { title: 'Risks awaiting decision', body: 'The question page behind the board’s panel on whether every risk at or above the action threshold has a security action planned or an exception, the SIRO’s decisions and the CISO’s agreement. A risk at or above the action threshold stops awaiting decision once the business agrees its treatment: a decision minuted at the Security Working Group, or the risk owner accepting it or its action. Until then the next step is owed by someone: the CISO to validate, the analyst to correct or decide the treatment, the risk owner to agree.' },
  'decisions.col.risk': { title: 'Risk', body: 'The system and the threat. Choose it to see the answer beneath, starting with who decided what.' },
